 to the fullest extent under applicable law, its rights to these trademarks and trade names. We do not intend our use or display of other companies&#8217; trade names, trademarks, or service marks to imply a relationship with, or endorsement or sponsorship of us by, any other company. </span></div><div style="height:42.75pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:6pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Akebia Therapeutics, Inc. | Form 10-Q | Page 1</span></div></div></div><div id="i722724a2aa0f48f38cfd149c1d381d33_16"></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:42.75pt;width:100%"><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline"><a style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline" href="#i722724a2aa0f48f38cfd149c1d381d33_13">Table of Contents</a></span></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">PART I&#8212;FINANCIAL INFORMATION</span></div><div id="i722724a2aa0f48f38cfd149c1d381d33_19"></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Item 1.&#160;&#160;Financial Statements.</span></div><div id="i722724a2aa0f48f38cfd149c1d381d33_22"></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;margin-top:6pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Akebia Therapeutics, Inc.</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;marg